WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.796
Good morning, Boss.

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:06.381
Here's today's schedule.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:10.719
A fitting for our opening party outfits.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.512
Please come to the Grand Hall.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.018
I'm going to create your outfits today.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:22.897
Tell me what you're looking for so
I can design the perfect outfit for you.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.400
A striped suit.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.194
I want some mushroom accessories
to go with it.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.071
Make a matching suit for Kikurage.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.700
As long as it's black, I don't care.

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:35.201
I want to look strong!

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:40.540
I want the trendy slim look.
With a herringbone pattern on a thick...

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:43.543
Lots of jewels! A tiara! Fur!

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:46.046
Something angelic, I think.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:47.839
Why are you here?

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:51.217
I have to go to try and renew
my partnership with you!

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:55.805
Four years ago, you kept me locked up
and didn't let me go.

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:59.434
There's no way you'd be able
to be my Partner.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:01.895
En.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.815
Are you still looking for
a Sorcerer who can control time?

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.443
He doesn't even exist.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.571
No, I know he does.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:13.740
And I'm going to find him.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.577
Next, let me take your measurements.

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:20.080
Bust, 62 cm.

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.832
Bust, 104 cm!

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:25.919
-Hey.
-Huh?

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:31.091
Boss, a word.

00:01:31.132 --> 00:01:32.842
I'm busy now. It can wait.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:36.096
It's about the smoke shop
you acquired the other day.

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:38.598
And signs of a Sorcerer
who can control time...

00:01:41.184 --> 00:01:46.481
Those looking for a partnership
with a Sorcerer in the En family,

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:51.194
please submit an application form
and a sample of your Magic.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.112
DONE

00:01:52.195 --> 00:01:54.489
SMOKE CHECK

00:01:56.699 --> 00:02:00.453
-Pass.
-Here's an invitation to the party.

00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:02.330
Fail!

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.499
Try again in four years.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:11.172
This is the tasting for the opening party.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.717
For the appetizer, we have
sautéed guinea fowl and porcini mushrooms.

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:19.222
And our dear Boss, made from candy.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.723
Wonderful.

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.350
DUO WEEKLY

00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:26.688
My lucky color is yellow,
and my lucky items are leather shoes.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.483
Beautiful!

00:02:30.525 --> 00:02:33.361
We will decorate the path
with these flowers.

00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:38.366
Here's the rehearsal for
the traditional play, Blue Night Miracle.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.703
"The sky shined blue with bugs."

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.996
This again?

00:02:44.539 --> 00:02:48.084
"The two Devils decided to work together."

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.919
-Yah!
-Yah!

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.379
I'm getting sleepy.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:57.385
"And so, the two reigned over Hell.
The end!"

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:02.599
What a busy day.

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:07.228
The Sorcerer that can control time.

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.356
They said he didn't exist.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.276
But if he actually does...

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.529
This year's Blue Night.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:21.409
Something that's never happened before
just might happen.

